    "rich_text_KckTAy": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_i3qdf3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Safety tapes are a highly versatile medium that allows companies to provide hazard warnings, mark safe zones and walkways, bring attention to potentially vulnerable areas, and direct employees and customers safely through the area. By providing clear visual cues, direction, and slip-resistant surfaces, safety tapes help people safely navigate a wide variety of potentially hazardous settings.</p><p>At NADCO, we understand the importance of workplace safety for customers and employees alike. Since every workplace has different hazards and risks, our safety tapes are available in a wide range of colors, finishes, materials, and sizes. Whether you’re looking for bright tape to direct customers safely through the grocery store, or reflective safety tapes that keep foot traffic away from heavy industrial machinery, we have the perfect adhesive tapes for your needs.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_i3qdf3"
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "t:sections.rich-text.name",
      "settings": {
